# --align rejects a word it does not know, even after good ones.
program Opp
arg --align
arg const,nocase,nofoo
arg tests/data/fmt-align.Mod
status 2
output
opp: --align takes words separated by commas: keep, drop, all, const, type, var, field, init, comment, case or assign, each of the last nine with or without no before it
